```java
@Bean
PasswordEncoder passwordEncoder() {
    return new Argon2PasswordEncoder(
        16,        // salt length in bytes
        32,        // output length in bytes
        1,         // parallelism
        19 * 1024, // memory in KiB
        2);        // iterations
}
```
*This matches one OWASP-listed minimum. Load-test it on the deployment platform, consider stronger settings when capacity allows, and use an encoded/delegating format so future policy changes can migrate existing verifiers.*
